  "claim_boundary": "This proof executes 1,590 independently observed Reimu-A SpawnBullets pre-states from the selected 2,000-frame replay prefix. It derives ranks 1-3, timer gates, lowest-free-slot allocation, carried fields, raw binary32 geometry, and a public digest covering all 422 initialized bullets. The retail/reference oracle compares 47 top-level fields and complete nested pre/post slot projections; the static audit pins 56 instruction roles. The fixed trigonometric outputs are trace- and table-bound rather than proved from the retail helper. Because UpdatePlayerBullets, ANM reclamation, and Enemy collision are not linked between calls, this is not an enclosing cross-frame bullet-state proof, a proof of compiler correspondence, or complete writer noninterference. Other shot routes, ranks 4-5, laser paths, collision, bomb execution, item interaction, and whole-game state remain outside the proved transition."
